<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 188-4 AT CLOSE OF PLAY IN FIFTH TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 188-4 AT CLOSE OF PLAY IN FIFTH TEST.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 188 for four wickets at close of play in reply to Australia's first innings total of 427 on the second day of the fifth test at Trent Bridge on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 427 (M.Taylor 76, S.Waugh 75, M.Elliott 69, M.Waugh 68, G.Blewett 50), England 188-4 (A.Stewart 87).</p>
